        "mulaIast": "dṛṣṭisṛṣṭer mukhyo'rthaḥ — ajñāna-tādātmyāpannā yā dṛṣṭiḥ saiva sṛṣṭiḥ, na tu tad-atiriktaṃ kiñcid astīti; tasyāśca vyavahāra-daśāyāṃ svapna-dṛṣṭāntena upapattiḥ |",
