    "mulaIast": "sa ca draṣṭaika eva | tannānātve mānābhāvāt | nanu-- kathameka eva jīvaḥ? pratiśarīraṃ `ahaṃ sukhī, ahaṃ duḥkhī, ahaṃ saṃsārī, ahamasya svāmi' ityādyanubhavavirodhāditi cenna | avidyāvaśād brahmaivaikaṃ saṃsarati | sa eva jīvaḥ | tasyaiva pratiśarīramahamityādibuddhiḥ | svāpnaśarīre `ayaṃ sukhī, ayaṃ duḥkhī' ityeva yatra buddhirna tvahaṃ sukhītyādi, tattu nirjīvam | yatra tvahamityādi tat sajīvam | jāgraccharīrāntare ahamiti pratītyavacchedake sajīvatoktirna dvitīyena jīvena sajīvatvamityabhipretya | tatra mānābhāvāt | bandhamokṣādivyavasthānupapattistatra mānamiti cenna | bandhamokṣaguruśiṣyādivyavasthāyāḥ svapnavadyāvadavidyamupapatteḥ | na caivaṃ tasminnekasminneva jīve supte samastajagadapratītyāpātaḥ | samaṣṭyabhimānino mukhyajīvasyāsuptatvāt | tasmin layakāle prasupte jagadapratīteḥ | antaḥkaraṇāvacchinne jīvābhāse tu supte tameva prati jagadapratītiḥ | na tvanyānapi prati | tapupādhīnāmapralīnatvāt | saṃskārasya kāraṇātmanā sthiterna suptasya punarutthānānupapattirityuktam |\n\netena- mama kalpakatve tava mokṣārthaṃ pravṛttyayogaḥ | tava kalpakatve tvatkalpitāsmadādibodhārthaṃ tava śabdaprayogādyanupapattiḥ | na ca svapnavat paryanuyogāyogaḥ | evamaparyanuyojyatve nirmaryādatayā kathānadhikāraprasaṅgāditi nirastam | caitramaitrādisarvābhimānino jīvasya kalpakatvena tava mametyādivikalpānupapatteḥ | nāpi svakriyādivirodhaḥ | svakriyāyāḥ kalpitatvādiniścayavirahakālīnatvena paryanuyogāyogāt | atha brahmaṇa eva jīvatvena tasyaiva bandhamokṣāviti tasya nityamuktatvādiśrutivirodhaḥ | na | mukteḥ svasvarūpatvena bandhasya cā'vidyakatvena tadavirodhaḥ | na hi mṛgatṛṣṇikākalpitodakena svabhāvaśuṣkā'pi marubhūmirārdrībhavati |\n\netena kalpitasya jīvasya kalpakaṃ prati pratyaktvāyogaḥ | tena kalpakena pratyaktvenājñānāt | anyasyānubhaviturabhāvāt | tathā'nubhavāpalāpe ekajīvādvaitaśrutyāderapyasiddhiriti nirastam | anekaśarīraikajīvavādasyāṅgīkārāt | na ca tarhi tameva prati pratyaktvaparāktvayorayogaḥ | maitraṃ prati tvamitidhīviṣayasya caitrasya tameva prati ahamitidhīviṣayatvāyogaśceti vācyam | bhinnabhinnāntaḥkaraṇābhedādhyāsena tattadantaḥkaraṇamādāya pratyaktvaparāktvāhamityādibuddhiviṣayatvavyavasthopapatteḥ | na ca caitrasukhaduḥkhādīnāṃ maitreṇānusandhānāpattiḥ | antaḥkaraṇāvacchinnenāvidyāvacchinnena vā? nādyaḥ | tatra parasparaṃ bhedāt | na dvitīyaḥ iṣṭāpatteḥ | ata eva caitrasya śuktisākṣātkāreṇa rajatabhramanivṛttāvanyeṣāmapi tannivṛttiḥ syāditi nirastam | antaḥkaraṇabhedena vyavasthopapatteḥ | nanu evaṃ muktāvapi caitrādyanyatamāntaḥkaraṇāvacchedena sākṣātkāre utpanne tadavacchedenaiva saṃsāranivṛttiḥ syāt, na tu taditarāntaḥkaraṇāvacchedenāpīti cenna | tatsākṣātkārasya savilāsamūlājñānanivṛttirūpatayā tatkāle'ntaḥkaraṇasyābhāvena vaiṣamyāt |\n\nnanu śrutiṣu `avidyāyāmantare vartamānāḥ' ityādāvavidyā, `ramaṇīyacaraṇāḥ' ityādau karmabandhaḥ, `sati sampadya na viduḥ' ityādau suṣuptiḥ, `vedāntavijñānasuniścitārthāḥ' ityādau tattvajñānaṃ, `parāmṛtātparimucyanti sarve' ityādau muktiśca cetanadharmaḥ kathamanekeṣūcyata iti cenna | `anādimāyayā supto yadā jīvaḥ prabudhyate' ityādiśrutisthaikavacanaprāptaikatvavirodhenodāhṛtaśrutīnāmanekatvaparatvābhāvāt | sarvajanīnabhramasiddhatadanuvādenāvirodhāt | na codāhṛtaśrutivirodhena `iti sṛṣṭau viniścitāḥ' iti pūrveṇa, `sa pūjyaḥ sarvabhūtānām' ityuttareṇa ca virodhenedamekavacanaṃ `yadā nītiparo rājā,' `svargakāmo yajeta' ityādivannaikatvaparamityeva kiṃ na syāditi vācyam | pratyaktvaparāktvamahamityādivyavahāraprayojakāntaḥkaraṇābhedādhyāsabalād bahutvasya prāptatvena pūrvottaravākyodāhṛtaśrutyādīnāmatatparatvāt | na ca muktabahutvaṃ nānyataḥ prāptamiti vācyam | jīvabahutvasya prāptatvena muktyaṃśa evāprāptatvaparyavasānāt | na caikasyaiva jīvasya sarvakalpakatve jīvasya kāraṇatvaṃ niṣidhya īśvarakāraṇatvavidhāyakaiḥ śrutyādibhirvirodhaḥ | avidyāyāḥ cinmātrāśrayatvopapādane nirasiṣyamāṇatvāt | na cai evaṃ sarvajñatvasarvakartṛtvādibodhakaśrutīnāṃ nirviṣayatvam | śuddhacaitanye jñattvasyaivābhāvāt | īśvarasya ca jīvabhinnasyābhāvād, jīve sārvajñyasyānubhavabādhitatvāditi vācyam | samaṣṭyabhimānino jīvasya sarvajñatvasarvakartṛtvādisvīkārāt | na cānubhavavirodhaḥ antaḥkaraṇābhedādhyāsabalāttadananubhavatadviparītānubhavayorupapatteḥ | sarvābhimāninastu sārvajñyānubhavo'styeva | ata eva `tānyahaṃ veda sarvāṇi na tvaṃ vettha parantapa ityādyupapadyate | na ca `ācāryavān puruṣo veda' iti śruterupadeśaṃ vinā jīvasya tattvajñānamanupapannam | upadeṣṭavyādanyasya caitanyasyābhāvācca nopadeśo yujyata iti vācyam | svapna ivopadeṣṭuḥ kalpitasya sambhavāt |\n\nnanu upadeṣṭṛtvaṃ na kalpitamātrasya | kintu tattvavittvena kalpitasya | tathā copadeśātprāk tattvajñāne tadaiva mokṣāpattiḥ | upadeśavaiyarthyaṃ ca | caivaṃ svapne'pi tulyam | tadā hi śabdaviśeṣavaktṛtvenaiva gurukalpanā, na tūpadeśasādhyajñānaviṣayaviśeṣavittveneti viśeṣāditi cenna | atrāpi tadvadeva vākyaviśeṣavaktṛtvenaiva tatkalpanasambhavāt | nanu tarhi `yadeva bhagavānveda tadeva me brūhi' ityādiśrutiḥ, `upadekṣyanti te jñānaṃ jñāninastattvadarśinaḥ' ityādismṛtiścāyuktā syāditi cenna | sāmānyato mokṣopayogijñānaviṣayavittvenājñātatattvavittvena tattvamasyādivākyavaktṛtvena vā kalpitasya upadeṣṭṛtvasambhavena udāhṛtavākyāvirodhāt | anyathā tavāpi mate tattvavittvena pramita evācāryatvenānusaraṇīya iti prathamata eva tattvajñāne tatkālamokṣāpattyupadeśavaiyarthyādikaṃ ca syāt | etena `svādhyāyapravacanābhyāṃ na pramaditavyam' ityādividhirapi bhāvitattvajñānikalpakacetanaṃ pratyeva | na ca tasya śiṣyaḥ svājñānakalpita iti jānatastanmokṣārthaṃ pravacane pravṛttiryuktā | na ca svapnavat kalpitatvājñānātpravṛttiḥ | tattvavidastadajñānānupapatteriti nirastam | svapnaguruvat kalpitatvena guroraparyanuyojyatvāt | na ca tattvajñānahetutvena vedasya mīmāṃsyatvavad gurorapi paryanuyojyatvamiti vācyam | tarkeṇa veda iva tattadrūpakalpanayā gurāvapi tatparihārāt | na ca kathāsvapi saduttarāparisphūrtāvahaṃ tvalkalpito na paryanuyojya ityuttaraṃ syāditi vācyam | kathāyāḥ kalpitatvāniścayakālīnatvena samayabandhaviśeṣanibandhanatvena ca tādṛguttarānavakāśāt | tasmācchiṣyavat gurorapi kalpitatvāt svapnavatsarvavyavasthopapattiḥ |"
