    "mulaIast": "anumānamapi tatra vivaraṇoktaṃ pramāṇam- `vivādapadaṃ pramāṇajñānam, svaprāgabhāvavyatiriktasvaviṣayāvaraṇasvanivartyasvadeśagatavastvantarapūrvakam, aprakāśitārthaprakāśakatvād, andhakāre prathamotpannapradīpaprabhāvaditi | atra pramāṇapadaṃ pramāṇavṛttereva pakṣatvena sukhādipramāyāṃ sākṣicaitanyarūpāyāmajñānānivartikāyāṃ bādhavāraṇāya | dharmyaṃśapramāṇavṛtteridamityākārāyā ajñānānivartikāyāḥ pakṣabahirbhāvāya vivādapadamiti viśeṣaṇam | viśeṣākārapramāṇavṛttiriti phalito'rthaḥ | parokṣapramāyā apyasattvāvaraṇarūpapramātṛgatājñānivartakatvāt na tadaṃśe'pi bādhaḥ | nanvidamiti pramāṇavṛtterajñānānivartakatve ajñātajñāpakatvarūpapramātvena vyavahāro na syāt, na idamākārabhramasaṃśayādarśanena tadgocarājñānakalpane mānābhāvena tatra sukhādijñānavadyathārthatvamātreṇa pramātvavyavahāropapatteḥ | yathāhuḥ- `dharmyaṃśe sarvamabhrāntaṃ prakāre tu viparyaya' iti | yadi tu bhramasaṃśayājanakamapi tadākāramajñānamanubhavabalādāsthīyeta, tarhi sāpi pakṣe'ntarbhavatu, pramāṇavṛttitvāvacchedenaivājñānanivartakatvānapāyāt, tadā ca vivādapadamiti viśeṣaṇamanādeyam | etasmin pakṣe bhramopādānatvayogyatvamavidyālakṣaṇaṃ draṣṭavyam, bhramopādānatvasya dharmyaṃśajñāna nivartyājñāne'vyāpterityavadheyam | dhārāvāhikabuddhīnāṃ ca tattatkālāvacchinnārthaviṣayatvenājñātajñāpakatvamastyeva; kālasya sarvapramāṇavedyatvābhyupagamāt | anātmākārapramāṇavṛttīnāṃ ca tattadavacchinnacaitanyaviṣayatvena svaviṣayāvaraṇanivartakatvamastyeva, cittvenaiva prakāśaprasakteḥ, na tvanavacchinnacittvena, gauravāt, `etāvantaṃ kālaṃ mayā na jñāto'yamidānīṃ jñāta' ityanubhavācca | rūpādihīnasyāpi tattadavacchinnacaitanyasya pratyakṣādiviṣayatvamuktaṃ prāk | pratikarmavyavasthāmabhyupagamya cedamanumānam, na tu dṛṣṭisṛṣṭipakṣa iti dhyeyam | sādhye cādyaṃ viśeṣaṇaṃ' pratiyogyatiriktā prāgabhāvanivṛttiriti mate prāgabhāvenārthāntaravāraṇāya | tadudīcyadhvaṃsādikamādāya nārthāntaraprasaktiḥ, kintu pūrvavarttyabhāvamādāyeti vastugatimanurudhya prākpadam | avaiyarthyaṃ ca pratiyogiviśeṣaṇatvenākhaṇḍābhāvasampādakatayā |\n\netena- yato jñānamajñānasyaiva nivartakamiti niyamāt svanivartyapadenaiva prāgabhāvavyudāse kimādyaviśeṣaṇeneti- nirastam; pramātvena jñānanivartyatvamanyeṣāṃ netyatra tātparyāt | na ca svaviṣayāvaraṇapadenaiva tadvyudāsaḥ, `asti prakāśata' iti vyavahāravirodhitvarūpasyāvaraṇatvasya bhāvābhāvasādhāraṇatvāt | vṛttijanakādṛṣṭenārthāntaravāraṇāya tu viśeṣaṇamidam | na cāvaraṇapadenaiva tadvyudāse svaviṣayeti vyartham, yadadṛṣṭaṃ svaviṣayajñānajanakaṃ viṣayāntarajñānapratibandhakatayā tadāvarakaṃ, tādṛśādṛṣṭapūrvakatvenārthāntaravārakatvāt |\n\nna ca jaḍe ajñānasyānaṅgīkārāccitaścājñānādisākṣitayā bhāsamānatvāt kvāvaraṇamitivācyam, ajñānādisākṣitayā citaḥ prakāśamānatve'pi `asti prakāśata' iti vyavahārābhāvena tadaṃśe'jñānāvaraṇasyāvaśyakatvāt | vakṣyate caitat | svanivartyeti ca viśeṣaṇaṃ vṛttipratibandhakādṛṣṭenārthāntaravāraṇāya | na ca- caramasākṣātkārotpattipratibandhakādṛṣṭasya tadanivartyatve mithyātvāsiddhiḥ tannivartyatve tadvyudasanamaśakyamiti- vācyam, pratibandhakādṛṣṭe vidyamāne na jñānotpattiriti prathamaṃ tannivṛtteḥ kāraṇātmanā sthitasya tasya jñānanivartyatvācca mithyātvam | na caivamapi svanivartyatvamavyāhatam, svanivartyasvarūpatve tātparyāt | andhakāreṇārthāntaravāraṇārthamidamiti- kecit | tanna, svadeśagatetyanenaiva tadvyudāsāt | yathā ca vṛttipratibimvitacaitanyasya viṣayāvacchinnacaitanyena sahaikalolībhāvādajñānanivartakatvaṃ, tathoktaṃ prāk | svadeśagateti ca viśeṣaṇaṃ viṣayagatājñātatvenārthāntaravāṇāya | yadyapyavidyāviṣayatvarūpamajñātatvamasiddham, jñātatvābhāvarūpaṃ tu prathamaviśeṣaṇenaiva parāstam, tathāpi prathamena prāgabhāvavyudāsādatyantābhāvavyudāsāya caturthamiti draṣṭavyam |\n\nnanu- kathaṃ jñānāśrayagatatvamajñānasya? vṛttyādirūpasya jñānasyājñānāśrayacidanāśritatvāditi cenna; antaḥkaraṇasya cidāśritatvena tadvṛttestatpratiphalitacaitanyasya vā jñānasya cidāśritatvasambhavāt, kiñcidavacchinnatadāśritasyāpi tadāśritatvānapāyāt, karṇaśaṣkulyavacchinnākāśāśritasya śabdasyākāśāśritatvavat | evaṃ ca bhāvābhāvasādhāraṇamāvaraṇamiti matena sādhyamupapāditam | abhāvo nāvāraka iti siddhānte tu sādhyadvaye tātparyam- svaprāgabhāvātiriktasvanivartyasvadeśagatavastvantarapūrvakamityekam | svaviṣayāvaraṇa (svanivartyasvadeśagatavastvantara) pūrvakamityaparamiti na kiñcidasamañjasam |\n\nhetau ca prakāśakatvaṃ prakāśakapadavācyatvaṃ, aprakāśavirodhitvaṃ vā jñānālokayoḥ sādhāraṇam | yadyapi prakāśakapadavācyatvaṃ nāmakaraṇavaśāt kasmiṃścit puruṣe'pyasti, tathāpi prakāśakaśabdena śāstre sarvadeśakālayorvā vyavahriyamāṇatvaṃ tadvivakṣitam | athavā'stu sādhāraṇam | aprakāśitārthagocareti viśeṣaṇād vyabhicāra vyudāsaḥ |"
